<title>UK: Munchener hypo prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Munchener hypo prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by joint lead managers BayerVB, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and WGZ Bank has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUNCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    01.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.41     PAY DATE    01.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    98.22     SPREAD	+3 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 MGT/UND    11 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT MAY 2004 TREUHAND</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE 526</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
